1) MatsSorbentTrapEvaluationNeeded is equal to true.
Runs once for each sorbent trap in an emission report.  The checks insure that the begin and end, dates and hours are correctly reported for each individual sorbent trap.
Note: the checks in this cateogry will update MatsSorbentTrapEvaluationNeeded.', 'LOC', NULL, 'HOUR');
1) MatsSorbentTrapEvaluationNeeded is equal to true
The check in the category determine whether the current hour is the first hour of a sorbent trap.  If it is the check sets MatsEvaluateSorbentTrap to true which will result in the evaluation of the sorbent trap and its sampling trains.  It will also reset parameters needed for the sorbent trap, sampling train and GFM evaluations.
If it is not the first hour of a sorbent trap the check will set parameters needed for the GFM evaluations based on values in MatsSorbentTrapDictionary.', 'LOC', NULL, 'QUARTER');
